# SHIPPED — Verified Product Capabilities & Proven Path

File: openOODA/SHIPPED.oot
This is what we have proved on disk. NORTHSTAR is the vision. ROADMAP is the active execution plan. Residual is wanted, not built.

## 1. Ground Truth & Proof

  Proof: files under `ooda/`, plus `oodac check oodac/main.oo`,
  or emit-c / emit-llvm + gcc/clang + run. `std/src` is not that proof.

## 2. Proven Capabilities

### Compiler Floor
  - Pin: v0.204.0-beta. Live check of `oodac/main.oo`: OK. RAM-cold about 164s; disk-warm new-process about 0.02s (179 modules).
  - C emit through `chs_rt`, then `gcc`. That is the product path.
  - `List[Name]` lowers to `OoL_Name` beside each struct typedef. `List[Float]` lowers to `OoFList` in `chs_rt`. Locks: `fixtures/list_struct_smoke.oo`, `fixtures/list_float_smoke.oo`, org `std/prove_smt_compact.oo`. One-level `List[List[Int]]` / `List[List[String]]` / `List[List[Float]]` lower to `OoLL_I` / `OoLL_S` / `OoLL_F`. Locks: `list_ll_int_smoke.oo`, `list_ll_str_smoke.oo`, `list_ll_float_smoke.oo`. Deeper nests stay residual.
  - `Result[Int]`, `Result[Name]`, `Result[List[Int]]`, `Result[Bool]`, `Result[Float]`, `Result[List[String]]`, `Result[List[Float]]`, and `Result[Void, String]` emit as `OoResI` / `OoRes_Name` / `OoResLI` / `OoResB` / `OoResF` / `OoResLS` / `OoResLF` / `OoResV`. Ok match is the payload, not `oo_int_to_str`. `Result[Int, Int]` is `OoResII` (int Err). Untyped `let r = Ok(7)` is `OoResI` with `7LL` (lock: `ok7_untyped_smoke.oo`). `call?` and Result `==` / `!=` on `Result[Int, String]` use `OoResI` / `oo_res_eq_i` (lock: `result_try_eq_smoke.oo`). Check stores Result T/E and refuses `g(f())` when T/E differ (lock: `tc_result_te.oo`). Locks: `result_int_smoke.oo`, `result_struct_smoke.oo`, `result_list_smoke.oo`, `result_bool_smoke.oo`, `result_float_smoke.oo`, `result_lstr_smoke.oo`, `result_lfloat_smoke.oo`, `result_void_smoke.oo`, `list_first_prod.oo`, `result_err_int_smoke.oo`. `Result[List[Name]]` emit is `ERR\tc_emit` (lock: `result_ll_name_fail.oo`). Other `E` types stay residual.
  - `list_set` is copy-on-write. Out of range prints `ERR` and exits 1. Locks: `list_set_smoke.oo`, `list_set_oob.oo`.
