atch_smoke.oo`). Check of `let dead = 1` with no use prints `unused let`, `-->` path, and `^` (lock: `scripts/unused_let_smoke.oo`). Check of `while true { 1 }` prints `while loop body must return Void`, `-->` path, and `^` (lock: `scripts/while_void_caret_smoke.oo`). Check of `f()` when `f` expects one arg prints `argument(s) but got`, `-->` path, and `^` (lock: `scripts/arity_caret_smoke.oo`). Check of a top-level unexpected token prints `ERR\tparse\tunexpected`, `--> path:line:col`, the line, and `^` (lock: `scripts/parse_caret_smoke.oo`). Check of a missing `}` prints `ERR\tparse\tunclosed brace`, `-->` path, and `^` (lock: `scripts/parse_unclosed_caret_smoke.oo`). `List[List[List[Int]]]` emit is `ERR\tc_emit` (lock: `scripts/list_lll_fail_smoke.oo`). `List[List[Int]]` still runs (`list_ll_int_smoke.oo`). `Result[Option[Int], String]` and `Result[Int, Bool]` emit stay `ERR\tc_emit`. User-sum `_` covers leftover variants; Option/Result with only `_` still refuses. Check of an unused named import prints `unused import`, `-->` path, and `^` (lock: `scripts/unused_import_smoke.oo`). User `oodac build` caches per-module `.o` and prints `cc_cache skip=N of M` (lock: `scripts/user_build_obj_smoke.oo`). emit-c of `List[Item]` pool writes `OoL_Item` and runs (lock: `scripts/list_node_pool_smoke.oo`).
